{"id": "t005-011", "text": "So I bumped into Seo-yeon at the station and she was saying her sister is getting married in Seoul on the 9th of October next year, and she's flying out on the 2nd, um, and she's quite stressed about the speech because she's maid of honour. Remind me to message her nearer the time to see how the speech is going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Seoul", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th of October next year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearer the time", "anchor": "a1"}]}
