{"id": "t005-060", "text": "Lunch with Afua and Karim, long one. Afua's sister is moving to Toronto on 1st March for a new job and Afua is gutted about it. Karim's doing his first half marathon on 16 Feb, still having a pint most nights though. We all want a curry night soon, maybe Friday the 7th at 7:30. Afua can't do anything too spicy since her stomach problems. Remind me to sort the booking by Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Toronto", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1st March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first half marathon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "16 Feb", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "having a pint most nights", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "curry night", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday the 7th at 7:30", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't do anything too spicy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "stomach problems", "owner